# Origin of the Stocks360 FastAPI backend. No trailing slash.
#
# 127.0.0.1 rather than localhost on purpose: on Windows, `localhost` can resolve to ::1
# while uvicorn is bound to 127.0.0.1, which fails as an opaque network error.
#
# The page itself must still be served from http://localhost:5173 — Firebase authorizes
# `localhost` as a sign-in domain by default and not 127.0.0.1.
#
# Whatever origin this app is served from has to be listed in the backend's
# CORS_ALLOW_ORIGINS, or every call here fails CORS preflight.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
